Sure, here is a neat implementation of the bubble sort algorithm in PHP:

```php
function bubbleSort(array $array): array
{
    $length = count($array);
    for ($i = 0; $i < $length; $i++) {
        for ($j = 0; $j < $length - $i - 1; $j++) {
            if ($array[$j] > $array[$j + 1]) {
                $temp = $array[$j];
                $array[$j] = $array[$j + 1];
                $array[$j + 1] = $temp;
            }
        }
    }

    return $array;
}
```

