3. Compile the code using the following command:
```bash
icc -o output_file input_file.cpp -xOmpSimd -xOmp -I/usr/include/oneapi -cxx-std=gnu++17
```
4. To run the code with OpenMP, we can use the following command:
```bash
./output_file
```
