The main classes and members within this namespace are used to declare and implement P/Invoke functions, marshal data between managed and native code, and perform other interop-related tasks. Some of the key classes and members in this namespace include:

1. DllImportAttribute: This is an attribute that you apply to a method in your managed code to declare that it uses native functions and specifies the necessary function signature, including the calling convention, return type, and parameters.
```csharp
