mediaRecorder->setVideoSettings(settings);
```

You need to use the `&` operator to pass the `settings` variable by reference, otherwise, it will be passed by value. When passing a variable by reference, any changes made to the variable inside the function will be reflected outside the function.

Here's an example of how you might call the `setVideoSettings` function with the `settings` variable passed by reference:
```scss
